     $$ \mathbf{n}_i = \frac{\nabla V(\mathbf{p}_i)}{\|\nabla V(\mathbf{p}_i)\|} $$
     [G] Handle zero-gradient voxels by assigning a default normal (e.g., $(0,0,1)$) to avoid division by zero.
